      "description": "Amen break - coming from the late 60's is one of the most famous drum loops sampled and remixed in hundreds of jungle, drum'n'bass and hiphop records. This six-second clip spawned several entire subcultures and gained massive fame among DJ's, producers and music fans.\n\nWe bring you the Amen Break Generator - a vintage-looking loop player designed for a real-time generating of infinite combinations of this famous break! You can remix the loop with your fingers, use looper and nonstop beat randomising algorithm and add various DSP effects.\n\n\nFEATURES:\n\n• Audio Unit v3 Support: Includes MIDI capabilities such as transport messages, slice triggering and loop selection using MIDI notes and running multiple instances \n• 16 Manual Trigger Buttons: Tempo-synced triggering of breaks for dynamic and creative control.\n• Live Remixing Effects: Instantly apply effects like Freeze, Step Randomization, Auto-Retrigger, and more to remix breaks in real-time.\n• Free-Play Mode: Manually trigger beat slices even when playback is stopped.\n• Built-in Looper: A powerful tool that repeats the last 16 steps of the played sequence, enabling seamless looping and overdubbing for effortless creativity.\n• Vintage-Inspired Graphics: Bitmaps in steam-punk style that enhance your experience.\n• 4 DSP Effects: Includes Ring Modulator, Stereo Hi-Pass Filter, Flanger, and Degrader for diverse sound manipulation.\n• Live WAV Recording: Capture your performance in high-quality WAV format, accessible directly in the iPhone’s Files app.\n• Custom Loop Import: Load up to 8 custom loops in WAV format.\n• 7 additional classic drum loops included for even more creative fun!",
